adex.org\/title\/b8272d78-498e-477c-8835-548d3f2370e4)\n- [Yancha Gal no Anjou-san](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/5e3a710f-0b0d-482b-9e84-d9c91960c625)\n- [Seishun Buta Yarou wa Siscon Idol wo Yume no Minai (Rascal Does Not Dream of Siscon Idol)](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/8587c766-37a3-4fb0-89db-8145fafb3152)\n- [Ogami Tsumiki to Kinichijou (Tsumiki Ogami's Not-So-Ordinary Life)](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/df361a38-eef6-4674-bec6-86d08aa1d1aa) (Ch. 1-8 w\/ [Emergency Tsumiki Comittee](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/group\/e62b19b7-e4a2-4119-a7c3-31b1c278ea59) & [Church of Potteto](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/group\/457ff7be-62ab-4552-83d8-ee3f3e1c02c1))\n- [Sasayaku you ni Koi wo Utau (Whisper Me a Love Song)](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/0e8fac17-979e-4e37-8f45-2c334b25d6dd) (SFX Only)\n- [Houkago, Bokura wa Uchuu ni Madou](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/91a2e0c9-cd81-4bf7-b5f7-bb37434bf6b3)\n\nOther stuff we have worked on:\n- [Kubo-san wa Boku (Mobu) wo Yurusanai (Kubo Won't Let Me Be Invisible) \u2014 Extras](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/cddd1849-ab36-4304-8103-06ba4062b5e6) [completed]\n- [Kubo-san wa Boku (Mobu) wo Yurusanai (Kubo Won't Let Me Be Invisible) \u2014 Oneshot](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/a7c87cce-0825-482b-af7d-2f5867972fa2\/kubo-san-wa-mob-wo-yurusanai) [oneshot]\n- [Hanamaru Hoppe](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/68b5d925-acf0-48d5-a051-c84446ce0d23) [oneshot]\n- [Alice-san Chi no Iroribata](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/0df86784-961a-443c-9765-8b41702c6249) [completed]\n- [Sukinako ga Megane wo Wasureta (The Girl I Like Forgot Her Glasses) \u2014 Twitter Extras](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/43541d36-7996-472b-aefb-72f640c29eda) [completed]\n- [Hana ni Arashi (Rainbows After Storms)](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/bc86a871-ddc5-4e42-812a-ccd38101d82e) [completed]\n- [Seishun Buta Yarou wa Yumemiru Shoujo no Yume wo Minai (Rascal Does Not Dream of a Dreaming Girl)](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/438a42fa-2fe4-45f3-9996-eea8f50c7382) [completed]\n- [Atri no Hon](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/d072a43a-4ced-4e92-b9a6-5d0b8029a3a5\/atri-s-book) [oneshot]\n- [Shinimodori Reijou no Lucetta (Lady Lucetta, Back from the Dead)](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/8546848b-0c69-4e1f-b6b5-4b0b3bf0cb3d) (w\/ [Shared Reads](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/group\/9f9f4d80-8a58-41cb-8bb3-a13426642ba5)) [dropped \u2014 web publishing]\n- [Osananananajimi (We're J-Just Childhood Friends)](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/8573d280-7f60-411d-b146-c97dca3c62f2) [dropped \u2014 simulpub]\n- [Anemone wa Netsu wo Obiru (The Anemone Feels The Heat)](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/c5d731f9-c1cf-4a69-a797-cd9c2a58316b) [complete]\n- [Koori no Jouheki (The Ramparts of Ice)](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/d2d0b8ea-4dfc-4d72-b584-5b26380f9bed\/koori-no-jouheki) [dropped \u2014 web publishing]\n\n\n### We're not sorry, we've learned nothing, we'll do it again.","twitter":null,"mangaUpdates":"https:\/\/www.mangaupdates.com\/group\/12je778","focusedLanguages":["en"],"official":false,"verified":false,"inactive":false,"publishDelay":null,"exLicensed":false,"createdAt":"2022-11-15T21:48:27+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-05-18T00:18:23+00:00","version":56}},{"id":"4d41149e-0ec8-4846-82a2-88d112b9dffa","type":"scanlation_group","attributes":{"name":"TSP","altNames":[{"en":"Tsundere Service Providers"}],"locked":false,"website":null,"ircServer":null,"ircChannel":null,"discord":null,"contactEmail":null,"description":null,"twitter":null,"mangaUpdates":null,"focusedLanguages":["en"],"official":false,"verified":false,"inactive":true,"publishDelay":null,"exLicensed":false,"createdAt":"2021-04-19T21:45:59+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-02-11T16:13:29+00:00","version":14}},{"id":"aaa9c59b-dec8-4c65-bfd8-27fe6ff7402d","type":"scanlation_group","attributes":{"name":"iltrof","altNames":[],"locked":true,"website":null,"ircServer":null,"ircChannel":null,"discord":"qXtkSYfp5X","contactEmail":null,"description":"WD: iltrof","twitter":null,"mangaUpdates":"https:\/\/www.mangaup